{"id":"17I","title":"Humility and Meekness","part":{"n":17,"title":"Personal character traits"},"url":"/law/17-personal-character-traits/17i","entries":[{"id":"17I.1","text":"We should seek and display meekness.","refs":[{"book":"Zephaniah","chapter":2,"verses":"3"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Titus","chapter":3,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Zeph. 2:3; Col. 3:12; Titus 3:2."},{"id":"17I.2","text":"Christians are to be meek as Christ was.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":11,"verses":"29"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":21,"verses":"5"},{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":10,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"Matt. 11:29; Matt. 21:5; 2 Cor. 10: 1."},{"id":"17I.3","text":"God requires that you walk humbly with Him.","refs":[{"book":"Micah","chapter":6,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Mic. 6:8."},{"id":"17I.4","text":"Blessed are the meek: for they shall inherit the earth.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":37,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":5,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"Psa. 37:11; Matt. 5:5."},{"id":"17I.5","text":"Do not set your mind on high things, but associate with the humble.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":12,"verses":"16"}],"citation":"Rom. 12:16."},{"id":"17I.6","text":"No man should glory or boast before God.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":1,"verses":"29"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 1:29."},{"id":"17I.7","text":"Meekness is the fruit of the Spirit.","refs":[{"book":"Galatians","chapter":5,"verses":"22-23"}],"citation":"Gal. 5:22-23."},{"id":"17I.8","text":"God resists the proud and scornful, but gives grace to the humble.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":3,"verses":"34"},{"book":"James","chapter":4,"verses":"6"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":5,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"Prov. 3:34; James 4:6; 1 Pet 5:5."},{"id":"17I.9","text":"Receive the word of God with meekness.","refs":[{"book":"James","chapter":1,"verses":"21"}],"citation":"James 1:21."},{"id":"17I.10","text":"The reward of humility and the fear of Christ is riches, honor and life.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":18,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":22,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":29,"verses":"19"}],"citation":"Prov. 18:12; Prov. 22:4; Isa. 29:19."},{"id":"17I.11","text":"Boasting is reproved.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":49,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":52,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":94,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":20,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":25,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":27,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":10,"verses":"15"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":9,"verses":"23"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":1,"verses":"30"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":11,"verses":"18"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":4,"verses":"7"},{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":10,"verses":"12"},{"book":"2 Timothy","chapter":3,"verses":"2"},{"book":"James","chapter":3,"verses":"5-6"},{"book":"James","chapter":4,"verses":"16"}],"citation":"Psa. 49:6; Psa. 52:1; Psa. 94:4; Prov. 20:14; Prov. 25:14; Prov. 27:1; Isa. 10:15; Jer. 9:23; Rom. 1:30; Rom. 11:18; 1 Cor. 4:7;2 Cor. 10:12; 2 Tim. 3:2; James 3:5-6; James 4:16."},{"id":"17I.12","text":"God will bring down high looks.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":18,"verses":"27"}],"citation":"Psa. 18:27."},{"id":"17I.13","text":"Do not justify yourselves before men, for that which is highly esteemed among men is an abomination in the sight of God.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":16,"verses":"15"}],"citation":"Luke 16:15."},{"id":"17I.14","text":"Humility is a characteristic of the godly and is regarded by God.","refs":[{"book":"Job","chapter":22,"verses":"29"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":9,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":10,"verses":"17"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":34,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":138,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":3,"verses":"34"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":16,"verses":"19"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":57,"verses":"15"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":66,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":4,"verses":"1-2"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"12"},{"book":"James","chapter":4,"verses":"6"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":5,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"Job 22:29; Psa. 9:12; Psa. 10:17; Psa. 34:2; Psa. 138:6; Prov. 3:34; Prov. 16:19; Isa. 57:15; Isa. 66:2; Eph. 4:1-2; CoL 3:12; James 4:6; 1 Pet 5:5."},{"id":"17I.15","text":"It is not profitable to boast.","refs":[{"book":"2 Corinthians","chapter":12,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"2 Cor. 12:1."},{"id":"17I.16","text":"A man's pride will bring him low, but a humble spirit will retain honor.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":29,"verses":"23"}],"citation":"Prov. 29:23."},{"id":"17I.17","text":"When pride comes, then comes shame, but with the humble is wisdom.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":11,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Prov. 11:2."},{"id":"17I.18","text":"Do not think of yourself more highly than you ought to think, but think soberly.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":12,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Galatians","chapter":6,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Rom. 12:2; Gal. 6:3."},{"id":"17I.19","text":"Whoever exalts himself shall be humbled; and whoever humbles himself shall be exalted.","refs":[{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":17,"verses":"24"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":23,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":14,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":18,"verses":"14"}],"citation":"Ezek. 17:24; Matt. 23:12; Luke 14:11; Luke 18:14."},{"id":"17I.20","text":"Humble yourselves in the sight of God that He may exalt you in due time.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":18,"verses":"4"},{"book":"James","chapter":4,"verses":"10"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":5,"verses":"6"}],"citation":"Matt. 18:4; James 4:10; 1 Pet 5:6."},{"id":"17I.21","text":"Temporal judgments are averted by humility.","refs":[{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":7,"verses":"14"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":12,"verses":"6-7"}],"citation":"2 Chron. 7:14; 2 Chron. 12:6-7."}]}